{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow Om's journey from being an amateur to an excellent sitarist as his travels bring him to a city that lives and breathes music. Explore its rich culture through food, art and stories that have been passed on for centuries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play sitar and <strong>compose</strong> your own music.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize</strong> your stage for sitar show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cook</strong> local Indian cuisine in the Dhaba (food-court).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Listen to Dadi's (Grandma) stories and <strong>collect</strong> story cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A beautifully hand-painted world inspired by <strong>Indian folklore</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An enticing <strong>adventure</strong> of love and discovery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/extras/Journal_Gif.gif?t=1742305253\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581900?t=1742305253","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581900?t=1742305253","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/324e70b99c286f88665cc4f3b5eb7a4241ca62f5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742305253","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581900/324e70b99c286f88665cc4f3b5eb7a4241ca62f5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742305253","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_parag